{
  "title": "创建新团队",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <h1>创建团队（仅限管理员）</h1>\n  <div class=\"WordSection1\">\n    \n    <ol class=\"Decimal\">\n      <li class=\"Content_body\">在导航窗格中，选择 <strong>管理&gt;团队&gt;创建新团队</strong>。新团队窗口将显示。<br>\n         </li>\n    </ol>\n    <figure_indented> <img height=\"595\" src=\"/aras-images/team1.jpg\" width=\"588\"> </figure_indented>\n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n    <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    \n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n    \n    <ol class=\"Decimal\" start=\"2\">\n      <li class=\"Content_body_indented\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">在 <b><i style=\"font-style: normal;\">Name（名称）</i></b> 字段中输入团队名称（必填）。</span></li>\n      <li class=\"Content_body_indented\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"> 在 <strong>Description（描述）</strong> 字段中输入团队的简要描述。<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></li>\n      <li class=\"Content_body_indented\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">点击添加身份组按钮 <img src=\"/aras-images/addbreakdownitem.jpg\"></span>。 <span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> 身份组搜索对话框将出现。</span></li>\n      <figure_indented> <img height=\"339\" src=\"/aras-images/selectid3.jpg\" width=\"819\"></figure_indented>\n      <li>点击 <img src=\"/aras-images/searchicon.jpg\"> 查看身份组列表。<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></li>\n      <li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">从搜索对话框中选择一个或多个身份组，然后点击 </span><img src=\"/aras-images/OK.jpg\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">。</span></li>\n      <li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">系统将所选的身份组记录作为新行填充到 <b><i style=\"font-style: normal;\">团队成员</i></b> 关系网格中。</span> <span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></li>\n      <li class=\"Content_body\" style=\"margin-top: 4.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">要为团队成员分配角色（可选），请在关系网格中双击角色</span>字段并点击省略号按钮 <img src=\"/aras-images/ellipses.jpg\">。身份组搜索对话框将出现。<br>\n        <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n        <p class=\"Note\">注意：搜索已预过滤为 IS Alias='0' 且 Classification='Team'，用户无法更改。</p>\n        <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n        <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n    <!--?rh-list_end ?--> <img height=\"209\" src=\"/aras-images/selid.jpg\" width=\"553\"><br>\n    <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                         list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n    <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    <ol start=\"6\">\n      <li>从搜索对话框中选择一个角色，然后点击 <img src=\"/aras-images/OK.jpg\"> 将该身份组添加到关系网格中。</li>\n    </ol>\n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n    <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n    <!--?rh-list_start class=\"rl-p-Note\" an=\"1\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                         list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    <p class=\"Note_indented\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">注意：<b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><i style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">角色</i></b>是可选的，可以留空。</span></p>\n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  </div>\n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "create_a_team.htm"
}